Warehouse feedback: the "Print Matched Label?" prompt auto-dismissed
after 3 seconds, and once it skipped itself the label was hard to find
again. The prompt (and the floating print-label toast for orders
without a matched PDF) now stays on screen until the packer explicitly
clicks Print or Skip. Countdown bar/text and their styles removed.

Verified in Chromium: prompt still showing 6+ seconds after completion,
and Print still opens the print dialog directly.

